  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/12/IMG_36581.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Los Salones Campus de Onda han&nbsp;celebrado la tarde de este s&aacute;bado una jornada de puertas abiertas para que las parejas de novios conozcan de primera mano sus instalaciones y sus servicios.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadapuertasabiertascampus13/img_3629.jpg\" alt=\"img_3629\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadapuertasabiertascampus13/img_3630.jpg\" alt=\"img_3630\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadapuertasabiertascampus13/img_3631.jpg\" alt=\"img_3631\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadapuertasabiertascampus13/img_3632.jpg\" alt=\"img_3632\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadapuertasabiertascampus13/img_3633.jpg\" alt=\"img_3633\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadapuertasabiertascampus13/img_3634.jpg\" alt=\"img_3634\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadapuertasabiertascampus13/img_3635.jpg\" alt=\"img_3635\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadapuertasabiertascampus13/img_3636.jpg\" alt=\"img_3636\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadapuertasabiertascampus13/img_3637.jpg\" alt=\"img_3637\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d471543